## Implementation Notes

- Use `dotenv` package for .env loading
- Throw errors early if config invalid (fail fast at startup)
- Non-null assertion (`!`) safe here because we validate presence first
- Domain keys lowercase ("java", "angular") for easy lookup
- All domains share same "Processed" label (global, not domain-specific)

